From: Somanath Bulusu <bsomanath@plume.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:03:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wps-monitor: manage dedicated onboarding VAP window

Isolate open/arm under one lock, gate presses on startup cleanup,
retry teardown until disabled, and avoid holding the lock during
blocking teardown so a new press cannot deadlock the monitor.

Signed-off-by: Somanath Bulusu <bsomanath@plume.com>

